
# String all Tricks and patterns to solve questions

1. Core String methods

   s.length()
   s.charAt(i)
   s.substring(start)          // from start to end
   s.substring(start, end)     // end EXCLUSIVE
   s.indexOf(char/String)      // -1 if not found
   s.lastIndexOf(char/String)
   s.toCharArray()
   s.split(regex)              // String[]
   s.equals(other)             // content compare
   s.equalsIgnoreCase(other)
   s.compareTo(other)          // lexicographic, <0 / 0 / >0
   s.contains(sub)
   s.replace(oldChar, newChar)
   s.trim() / s.strip()
   s.toLowerCase() / s.toUpperCase()
   s.isEmpty() / s.isBlank()
   s.startsWith(prefix) / s.endsWith(suffix)
   s.repeat(n)                 // Java 11+
   String.valueOf(x)           // int/char/etc -> String
   String.join(",", list)      // join array/list with delimiter

2. Character class helpers (huge time-savers)

   Character.isDigit(c)
   Character.isLetter(c)
   Character.isLetterOrDigit(c)
   Character.isUpperCase(c) / isLowerCase(c)
